===============================================================================
Other external command-line tools
===============================================================================

The container image also installs unrelated open-source security tools
(nmap, ffuf, katana, nuclei, httpx, naabu, golangci-lint, ...) and invokes
them the same way — as separate processes. Their licenses and copyright
notices remain with their respective upstream projects; they are not part of
the Xalgorix source distribution.
